    <summary>We establish stable quantum ergodicity for spin Hamiltonians, also known as Pauli-Schrödinger operators. Our approach combines new analytic techniques of mixed quantization, inspired by local index theory, with stable ergodicity results for partially hyperbolic systems.</summary>
